# Vendored npm tarballs are binary. `package-lock.json` records a sha512 integrity hash for
# web/vendor/*.tgz, so any byte change — including a line-ending rewrite from a future
# `* text=auto` rule — breaks `npm ci` with EINTEGRITY, in CI, with no local reproduction.
# See web/vendor/README.md.
*.tgz binary

# Same reasoning for the generated icon assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
